# Only Isabelle theories and their ML sources, ROOT/ROOTS files, LaTeX PDF
# sources, and the Python scripts already present on origin/more_algorithms
# are eligible for tracking. Everything else stays local.
*
!*/
!*.thy
!*.ML
!ROOT
!ROOTS
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.sty
!*.cls
!*.bst
!/.gitignore

# Exact upstream Python paths; do not allow local helper scripts generally.
!/AI_Style/line_breakdown.py
!/AI_Style/locale_struct.py
!/AI_Style/size_split.py
!/AI_Style/style_stats.py

# editor backups and autosaves
*~
\#*#
.#*

# scratch theories used for proof experiments during refactorings
Scratch*.thy

# refactoring plans and metrics (also covered by the whitelist above;
# listed explicitly so they stay ignored if the whitelist is relaxed)
*_Plan.md
*_Metrics.md

# snapshot copies of theories taken before refactorings
refactoring_checkpoints/

# Generated code and build output, including any .ML or .tex files within them.
generated/
generated_*/
output/
AI_Provenance/lib/
